// `#[at_least_one]` on `merge`'s variadic parameter: with no map there is nothing to take `K` and
// `V` from and nothing to answer, so the call is refused rather than answering an empty map of
// some inferred-from-nothing type. The same reason `add` and `remove_all` carry it.
fn main() {
    print(len(merge()))
}
